#. Part of the goal never fits, whatever the time, so this is the most any daily time covers. In the month form, {date} is a month, like "May 2027"; otherwise a day, like "May 5". {time} is a daily study time, like "8 h"; {share} a percentage, like "99%".
#: src/_components/time-answer-texts.ts
msgctxt "MTkVRt"
msgid "{dateKind, select, month {Covering as much as any daily time can by {date}, about {share} in depth, takes about {time} a day, more than most people can keep up.} other {Covering as much as any daily time can by {date}, about {share} in depth, takes about {time} a day, more than most people can keep up.}}"
msgstr "{dateKind, select, month {Per studiare il massimo possibile entro {date}, con una parte studiata a fondo pari a circa {share} del totale, servono circa {time} al giorno, più di quanto la maggior parte delle persone riesca a sostenere.} other {Per studiare il massimo possibile entro il {date}, con una parte studiata a fondo pari a circa {share} del totale, servono circa {time} al giorno, più di quanto la maggior parte delle persone riesca a sostenere.}}"

#. In the month form, {date} is a month, like "May 2027"; otherwise a day, like "May 5".
