#. {instrument} names what the learner wants to play, or singing, like "guitar".
#: src/onboarding/entry/goal-outcomes.tsx
msgctxt "irzzdg"
msgid "Musicianship for {instrument}: hear chords, read short melodies and keep the beat. No microphone needed."
msgstr "Formazione musicale per {instrument}: riconosci gli accordi, leggi brevi melodie e tieni il tempo. Non serve un microfono."

